    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73446" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμείχ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make water,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ ἀντ᾽ ἠελίοιο τετραμμένος ὀρθὸς
					ὀμείχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					727
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.17
			</span></i> : aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμειξα, ὤμειξεν αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippon.
					55A.
				</span></i>
			 (Misspelt <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμιχεῖν</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμιξεν</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμηξεν</span> in codd. ; cf. Skt.
				<i>méhati,</i> Lat. <i>meiere,</i> etc.)</div>
